Bootstrap Form Inputs
<div class="form-group">
    <label for="name">Name:</label>
    <input type="text" class="form-control" id="name">
</div>

<div class="form-group">
    <label for="password">Password:</label>
    <input type="password" class="form-control" id="password">
</div>
Muhim:
type="text"     → oddiy matn
type="password" → parol
class="form-control" → Bootstrap input dizayni
Bootstrap HTML5 input turlarini ham qo‘llaydi:
text
password
date
month
time
week
number
email
url
search
tel
color
2. Textarea
Ko‘p qatorli matn yozish uchun ishlatiladi.
<div class="form-group">
    <label for="comment">Comment:</label>

    <textarea class="form-control"
              rows="5"
              id="comment"></textarea>
</div>
Bu yerda:
textarea → ko‘p qatorli input
rows="5" → 5 qator balandlik
.form-control → Bootstrap style
