5. Radio Buttons
<div class="radio">
    <label>
        <input type="radio" name="language">
        HTML
    </label>
</div>

<div class="radio">
    <label>
        <input type="radio" name="language">
        CSS
    </label>
</div>

<div class="radio">
    <label>
        <input type="radio" name="language">
        JavaScript
    </label>
</div>
//KEYWORD
→ Form ichidagi input elementlarini Bootstrap bilan style qiladi.

.form-control → input, textarea, select uchun Bootstrap style

input:
type="text" → matn
type="password" → parol
type="email" → email
type="number" → raqam
type="date" → sana
type="search" → qidiruv

textarea → ko‘p qatorli matn
rows → textarea balandligi

.checkbox → checkbox
.checkbox-inline → checkbox bir qatorda
disabled → tanlab bo‘lmaydi

.radio → radio button
.radio-inline → radio bir qatorda
name → bir guruh radio
checked → oldindan tanlangan

select → tanlash ro‘yxati
option → ro‘yxatdagi variant

